--- E2. backend STARTED while the database is already down ---
    This exercises the application-level retry loop, which is the safety
    net for cold starts. It matters because depends_on/service_healthy is
    a Compose-time construct: when the DAEMON restarts, containers are
    started by restart policy in arbitrary order and the dependency
    ordering is NOT replayed. Without this loop, a backend that wins the
    race against Postgres would crash-loop.

